---
layout: base.njk
title: "お知らせ"
description: "Wieのイベントや活動に関する最新のお知らせです。"
---
{% from "partials/media.njk" import wiechan %}
{% from "partials/cards.njk" import newsCard %}

<section class="section page-sky">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">お知らせ</p>
      <h1>お知らせ</h1>
    </div>

    {% if news.length %}
    <div class="news-filter" role="group" aria-label="タグで絞り込む" hidden>
      <button type="button" class="news-filter__btn" data-tag="" aria-pressed="true">すべて</button>
      {% for t in news | newsTags %}
      <button type="button" class="news-filter__btn" data-tag="{{ t }}" aria-pressed="false">#{{ t }}</button>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% set current = news | currentNews %}
    {% set ended = news | endedNews %}
    <div class="grid grid--3" id="news-cards" data-news-list>
      {% for n in current %}{{ newsCard(n) }}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="text-muted" id="news-filter-empty" hidden>このタグのお知らせはまだありません。</p>
    {% if ended.length %}
    <div class="news-ended" id="ended" data-news-ended>
      <h2 class="news-ended__title">開催終了したイベント</h2>
      <div class="grid grid--3" data-news-list>
        {% for n in ended %}{{ newsCard(n) }}{% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    <script src="{{ '/js/news-filter.js' | url }}" defer></script>
    {% else %}
    <div class="news-empty">
      {{ wiechan("wiechan-default.png", "Wieちゃん") }}
      <p style="margin:0;">現在、お知らせは準備中です。次回のイベントが決まり次第、こちらでご案内します。</p>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
